  "probe_constraints": [
    "Optional XMS cache allocation is refused for disk-fault cases. The real-XMS case removes only the clean read cache to target dirty write-cache retrieval.",
    "The before-image is in memory. Old-record visibility is guaranteed through DBB APIs until rollback; external raw reads may observe a partial failed write.",
    "Temporary discard tests require the before-image to survive handle-close refusal, then be released after successful close even when deletion remains pending.",
    "This is a single-record runtime transaction, not a crash-recovery journal or a multi-record editor transaction.",
    "Legacy Put remains unchecked for its own updates; its guard only prevents bypassing an existing pending rollback."
  ],
